["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasResolution", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` ResolutionAction point to the `to` OutOfSpecAction that is addressed.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
